<title>UK: KfW sets 300 million mark 10-year fixed/FRN.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 300 million mark 10-year fixed/FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.0	 MATURITY    02.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED/FRN     ISS PRICE  102.35    PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN CHANGES TO FRN PAYING</p>
<p>		6M LIBOR +50 BP. HOWEVER IF 6M LIBOR EXCEEDS 8.0 PCT</p>
<p>		COUPON REVERTS BACK TO FIXED-RATE COUPON OF 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
